sequenceDiagram
 participant U as Usuario Vue
 participant API as Spring Boot
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 U->>API: POST /auctions/{id}/bids
 API->>DB: BEGIN; SELECT auctions FOR UPDATE
 DB-->>API: Lock adquirido
 API->>DB: SELECT mejor bid
 DB-->>API: max(amount)
 alt Bid valido
   API->>DB: INSERT bids; COMMIT
   API-->>U: 201
 else Bid invalido o vencido
   API->>DB: ROLLBACK
   API-->>U: 409/422
 end
